Apply the denyRead masks after the mandatory and denyWrite read-only binds. Those bind the
real path over itself, and bubblewrap's last mount wins, so denyWrite ~/.ssh re-exposed
~/.ssh/id_* that denyRead had masked (same for ~/.gnupg and ~/.config/greywall-agents/figcraft).
Not upstream yet; applies on top of greyproxy-secrets-pr103.patch.

